  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.2.2 / v18.2.2: Package title cleanup - the NuGet package title no longer carries the \"for Umbraco N\" suffix, so the marketplace listing shows the plain product name. No functional, API, UI or database changes. v17.2.1 / v18.2.1: Version lines now follow the Umbraco major (17.x for Umbraco 17, 18.x for Umbraco 18) and each line's Umbraco.Cms.Api.Management dependency is boxed to a single major - [17.0.0, 18.0.0) and [18.0.0, 19.0.0) respectively. Previously a single net10.0 build declared [17.0.0, 19.0.0), which let a host pinned to Umbraco 17 be pulled up to Umbraco 18 whenever another package in the project graph demanded 18. Boxing the range per major prevents that cross-major drift: installing into an Umbraco 17 site always resolves the 17.x line and never forces an 18 upgrade. Umbraco 16 (the old net9.0 target) is no longer supported. No functional, API, UI or database changes - this is a packaging/compatibility change only. v2.1.0: Run-level AI Readiness. The per-page AI-readiness sub-score is now persisted in a dedicated AiReadinessScore column, averaged into the run overview (avg AI readiness card next to avg SEO score), listed as its own column in the pages grid and included in the CSV export. UrlPatternMatcher/EmissionsCalculator deduplicated - SEOAudit now consumes both from T4VN.Seo.Core v1.1.1 (which caches compiled glob regexes). No breaking API changes. v2.0.2: AI Readiness audit â€” new audit category that checks robots.txt AI-bot rules (GPTBot, CCBot, etc.), /llms.txt presence, /ai.txt presence, JSON-LD validity, FAQ schema, breadcrumb schema, authorship dates, external citations, and Content-Signal header; included in the per-page detail and SEO score. Webhook notifications â€” new WebhookUrl and WebhookScoreThreshold options to POST an alert when health or SEO scores drop below a threshold. Run comparison API (CompareRuns endpoint) returning score deltas between two runs. HTML report endpoint (GetReport) for print-to-PDF audit reports. UI split into dedicated Overview, Content Pages and Media Pages dashboards for better navigation. Vietnamese localization added. App_Plugins folder renamed from \"seo-audit\" to \"utpro-seo-audit\". Upgraded to T4VN.Seo.Core v1.1.0 (AI Readiness engine). No breaking API changes. v1.0.0: Initial release. Site-wide SEO & content audit for Umbraco 16, 17 and 18. Crawls every Content & Media URL, checks broken links/images/resources, and audits each page for SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content quality, accessibility and carbon emissions. Includes a composite SEO score (Lighthouse-style, 0-100), a run health score, grouped issues with severity/priority, orphaned-page and duplicate-content detection, incremental scans, CSV export and a per-page detail modal. Adds a per-node SEO Audit tab in the Content/Media editors (auto-scans on open). Runs as a recurring background job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor). Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine. Config key: uTPro:Feature:SEOAudit.",
